<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results World Cup Asian zone group one qualifying matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia  0  Malaysia    0</p>
<p>    Taiwan	  3  Bangladesh  1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Taiwan - Lin Wen-han 60, Huang Che-ming 62, Cheu Kuei-jen 77</p>
<p>Bangladesh - Jwal Rana, 55</p>
</text>
